Date: Wed, 6 Aug 2025 09:53:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 432/540] Changelogs: 1. cpufreq control delete boost_1_6ghz
 flag; 2. CLK_FREQ_1600M/CLK_FREQ_1500M voltage change to 0.9v default; 3.
 delete 1.2G and 1.3G frequency because impacting on the stablility of d2d

---
